Marker file identifying the repository root.

Python  :  ROOT = next(p for p in [Path.cwd(), *Path.cwd().parents]
                       if (p / ".projectroot").exists())
R       :  see the `find_project_root()` helper at the top of each script.

Do not delete or move this file — every script and notebook locates its
data through it, so that the repository works from any checkout location.
